#: /Game/Blueprints/CharacterCreation/UMG_VintercoinRedeemScreen.UMG_VintercoinRedeemScreen_C:ExecuteUbergraph_UMG_VintercoinRedeemScreen [Script Bytecode]
msgid "If you've spent a good amount of time playing Longvinter, you can now claim Vintercoins retroactively based on your playtime. Simply ensure your playtime settings are public, then click 'continue' to claim your reward."
